  "description": "The annual average fell from 375,000 in 2000 to 247,000 in 2025. One point per complete year; the vertical axis starts at 200,000 to reveal the trend. The latest quarter is separate: about 245,900 workers in February 2026. This counts the agriculture industry, not just the farmer occupation."
